Reason:
The documentation incorrectly described the `capacity` parameter as the maximum size of each sub-queue, leading to confusion about the actual total capacity of the `FairCallQueue`. This misunderstanding allowed the total size of the call queue to exceed the configured maximum capacity, especially when the number of priority levels was not properly accounted for.

